05)------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[WORKSPACE_ROOT/datafusion/sqllogictest/test_files/scratch/filter_pushdown_column_mapping/c.parquet]]}, projection=[key], file_type=parquet
06)------RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(4), input_partitions=1
07)--------ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as b_id, id@1 as a_id]
08)----------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(k@1, k@1)], projection=[id@2, id@0]
09)------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[WORKSPACE_ROOT/datafusion/sqllogictest/test_files/scratch/filter_pushdown_column_mapping/a.parquet]]}, projection=[id, k], file_type=parquet
